#
# What the build context of docker/Dockerfile leaves out: the context is the
# repository's root, and this file, beside the Dockerfile, is the one BuildKit
# reads for it. Nothing that holds a key is ever sent to the builder.
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/node_modules
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
frontend/dist
backend/dist
demo/.state
tmp
